### 0 cli render units.wtf --format text
$ wtf render units.wtf --format text --root <root> --now 2026-09-16T14:00:00-04:00
exit 0
--- stdout
[budget] := minimize(30m * calls + 1h * visits) = 200m · calls 0 · visits 3.3333
| constraint | expression               |
| ---------- | ------------------------ |
| coverage   | calls + 3 * visits >= 10 | 10 ≥ 10 · ● binding

### 1 cli query units.wtf plans | select {name, display, solution} --json
$ wtf query units.wtf plans | select {name, display, solution} --json --root <root> --now 2026-09-16T14:00:00-04:00
exit 0
--- stdout
[
  {
    "display": "200m",
    "name": "budget",
    "solution": {
      "columns": [],
      "constraints": [
        {
          "anchor": {
            "character": 41,
            "line": 3
          },
          "binding": true,
          "lhs": 10,
          "name": "coverage",
          "op": ">=",
          "range": {
            "end": {
              "character": 39,
              "line": 3
            },
            "start": {
              "character": 15,
              "line": 3
            }
          },
          "rhs": 10,
          "slack": 0
        }
      ],
      "goal": "minimize",
      "objective": {
        "seconds": 12000,
        "type": "duration"
      },
      "variable_order": [
        "calls",
        "visits"
      ],
      "variables": {
        "calls": 0,
        "visits": 3.3333
      }
    }
  }
]

