### 7 cli render unbounded.wtf --format text
$ wtf render unbounded.wtf --format text --root <root> --now 2026-09-16T14:00:00-04:00
exit 1
--- stdout
[p] := maximize(x)
| constraint | expression |
| ---------- | ---------- |
| floor      | x >= 1     |
--- stderr
<root>/unbounded.wtf:1:17: error: The objective can be raised without limit; add a constraint that bounds it
wtf: 1 error(s) while rendering

